subckt CLKC (VDD VSS CLKC CLKS Valid CLK0)
X1 (net0 CLKC VDD VSS) buffer td=10p vt=10m
X10 (CLK0 CLKS net2 VDD VSS) or_gate td=10p vt=10m
X2 (net1 net0 VDD VSS) delay_cell tpd=20n vt=10m
X9 (net2 Valid net1 VDD VSS) nor_gate td=20n vt=10m
