subckt dut (VDD VSS Vinp Vinn CLKS)
X1 (VDD VSS Vcomp Vcomn CLKC Doutp Doutn) COMP
X10 (net3 net2 VDD VSS) inverter td=10p vt=10m
X2 (Doutp Doutn Valid VDD VSS) or_gate td=10p vt=10m
X24 (VDD VSS VDD VSS Vcomp Vcomn net1 net4 net5 net6 net7 net8 net2 net9 net10 net11 net12 net13) CDAC
X3 (VDD VSS Valid Doutp net0 net9 net10 net11 net12 net13 CLKS CLK0) Bottem_plate_Ctrl
X4 (VDD VSS Valid Doutn net3 net4 net5 net6 net7 net8 CLKS NC0001) Bottem_plate_Ctrl
X5 (VDD VSS Vinp CLKS CLKSB Vcomp) Bootstrap_switch
X6 (VDD VSS Vinn CLKS CLKSB Vcomn) Bootstrap_switch
X7 (CLKS CLKSB VDD VSS) inverter td=10p vt=10m
X8 (VDD VSS CLKC CLKS Valid CLK0) CLKC
X9 (net0 net1 VDD VSS) inverter td=10p vt=10m
